SECTION | KEY | VALUE
------------------------------
# auto.manifest.pdl - sfx-hai opts in to the auto conductor (BOOK 17.ai/AUTO-AND-AUTO-STUDIO-DESIGN.md). Paths are relative to the house root. ops: &.widgits/auto/ops (auto_act, auto_observe, auto_plan).
# READY | verb | file | text | timeout s   (wait until the file contains the text before pressing: a busy window drops presses)
# APP | name | pid file          STATE | name | file | append|rewrite          VERB | id | press target | expect kind | file | text | timeout s | safety          NOTE | verb | file | field (1-based, last line)
# expect kinds: grew (append-only file must grow; with text, the new last line must also contain it) | lastline-contains | lastline-absent (needs growth too) | none.   safety OWNER = never automatic.
APP | sfx-hai | &.hq-apps/sfx-hai/state/renderer.pid
STATE | ui | &.hq-apps/sfx-hai/state/ui.txt | rewrite
STATE | ledger | &.hq-apps/sfx-hai/state/ledger.txt | append
# make = render the selected sound and run its numeric checks; success = the append-only SFX ledger grew and the new row has no FAIL. NOTE keeps the sound's name (field 3 of the SFX row).
VERB | make | make | lastline-absent | &.hq-apps/sfx-hai/state/ledger.txt | FAIL | 40 | free
READY | make | &.hq-apps/sfx-hai/state/ui.txt | busy=0 | 30
NOTE | make | &.hq-apps/sfx-hai/state/ledger.txt | 3
VERB | play | play | none | &.hq-apps/sfx-hai/state/ui.txt | - | 5 | free
VERB | freq_up | fp | none | &.hq-apps/sfx-hai/state/ui.txt | - | 5 | free
VERB | freq_down | fm | none | &.hq-apps/sfx-hai/state/ui.txt | - | 5 | free
# verdicts are judgements, never automatic
VERB | owner_yes | jo_yes | none | &.hq-apps/sfx-hai/state/ui.txt | - | 5 | OWNER
VERB | owner_no | jo_no | none | &.hq-apps/sfx-hai/state/ui.txt | - | 5 | OWNER
VERB | claude_yes | jc_yes | none | &.hq-apps/sfx-hai/state/ui.txt | - | 5 | OWNER
VERB | claude_no | jc_no | none | &.hq-apps/sfx-hai/state/ui.txt | - | 5 | OWNER
